{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Defensively copy mutable preview leaves.** Arrays and other mutable values bypass the map/collection copying here, so callers can mutate `preview()` through the original object after construction. This can even change the encoded envelope after filesystem size validation. Clone/normalize arrays and other supported mutable JSON values, or reject unsupported leaf types.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7opOqE","finding_digest":"9789e271f1cd1379428efcf3d81fbf80eb5e0266bc1a10397846cf8910aa470a","finding_id":"arf_v1_s6e6e4przujxsquo7tz5qh57qd","finding_key":"sdk/offload/offloadedpayload::immutablevalue::array-defensive-copy","identity_key":"sdk/offload/offloadedpayload::immutablevalue::array-defensive-copy","line":225,"observation_digest":"5622aca1a9b1f367b8a499825623c9ce0271e835e960bb442d61ede87fe74c3c","observation_id":"aro_v1_kyrkzinjwhzwpofetgbfmi6jzy","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/offload/OffloadedPayload.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T10:20:12Z","review_id":"arr_v1_3ygmss3glef2qls4x47sy5gy3i","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"fc7c6192dd7b2ff36075563842318caf68d77f46","reviewer":"codex","start_line":225,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":649},"record_id":"art_v1_rtxbqm6i5upyn2eqel4n5bqxzz","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T10:20:12Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
